Is it socially and ethically feasible?
* To maintain fairness of the games, end users will be asked to check CAPTCHA box, the users will have to undergo whether they are a bot or human check. This is to authenticate application users (Brodić & Amelio, 2020). 
* The games will not have any suggestive, offensive, harmful, and socially unacceptable content.   
* Since the games are limited to maximum 5 min play, we mitigate the risk of addiction to the games and the attached reward system 
* The games are suitable for all ages, as the application does not fall in the scope of social media platform, adult supervision or age restricted platform.   Therefore, it counters moral concerns about the platform usage by underaged children.
The platform functions within the frameworks laid by Australian eSafety and AHRC supporting transparent and proportionate value exchange participants — ensuring content standards, consent obligations, and anti-discrimination principles are upheld while preserving the economic rights of creators and the safety of all users. 